1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:04,780
This is the story of a band of brave
heroes

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,700
who fate once united.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,780
Bjarni, a proud Viking and the discoverer
of a new world.

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:14,140
Cyra, a fair princess of the Orient.

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:17,300
Sigurd, a hero from the Frankish Empire,

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,360
and Hatchie, the brave Saracen.

7
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:23,520
Together they had already survived many
fights and adventures,

8
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:26,920
but now the world was threatened by a
menace so great

9
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,720
it could shake even the realm of the gods.
